-- =====================================================================
-- =====================================================================
-- GLOBAL DOCTORAL TRAINING AND KNOWLEDGE BROKERAGE
-- MASTER BIGQUERY BUILD -- PNAS VERSION
--
-- DESIGN PRINCIPLES
-- -----------------
-- 1. Expensive OpenAlex scans are performed once.
-- 2. Citation infrastructure remains country-agnostic.
-- 3. Final analysis panel includes top 50 degree-country categories.
-- 4. authorships_truncated is STORED, never used as a required filter.
-- 5. Country completeness is measured empirically.
-- 6. Both team-level and focal-AARC self-citations are identified.
-- 7. Current target-country collaboration is separately identified.
-- 8. Multiple definitions of country provenance are preserved.
-- 9. Organizational variables needed for later spillovers are preserved.
-- =====================================================================
-- =====================================================================


-- =====================================================================
-- 0. RAW COUNTRY CROSSWALK
--
-- USSR intentionally receives NULL:
-- it is not mapped to Russia.
--
-- "Korea" receives KR provisionally.
-- Verify DegreeInstitutionName for these 42 faculty.
-- =====================================================================

